{"id": "EUVD-2026-71024", "enisaUuid": "c99dc904-ee56-34ff-b03e-82ba2e8c7038", "description": "Grav Admin before 2.0.20 fails to sanitize output from marked.parse() before injecting it into the DOM via Svelte's {@html} directive in MarkdownEditor and MarkdownModal components. Attackers can inject javascript: URI schemes in plugin or theme changelogs to execute arbitrary code in authenticated admin sessions without requiring site access.", "datePublished": "2026-09-04T11:30:03", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-10T15:09:23", "baseScore": 5.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:A/VC:N/VI:N/VA:N/SC:L/SI:L/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/getgrav/grav/security/advisories/GHSA-752r-88j4-vxm3", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/grav-admin-before-2.0.20-cross-site-scripting-via-marked-js"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-85601", "GHSA-pqmm-93p6-x64h"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.28, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "ae82fad9-c60e-3975-888d-89d75e389852", "product": {"name": "grav", "vendor": {"name": "getgrav"}}, "product_version": "0 <2.0.20"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "afd6ff36-a051-3e2e-8199-8521ed227e4b", "vendor": {"name": "getgrav"}}], "isExploited": false}